# ════════════════════════════════════════════
# Docker 构建上下文排除清单
# 目标：镜像只含代码与依赖，不含密钥/运行时数据/本地依赖
# ════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── 密钥（禁止进镜像；config.py load_dotenv(override=True)，带 .env 会覆盖容器环境变量）───
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
credentials.json

# ─── Python ───
backend/venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ─── 前端 ───
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/

# ─── 运行时数据（由 docker-compose 挂载卷提供，不进镜像）───
data/knowledge/
data/conversations/
data/profiles/
backend/data/
backend/eval_data/

# ─── 测试与工具脚本（非运行时必需）───
backend/tests/
backend/scripts/
backend/test_data.py
backend/requirements-dev.txt

# ─── 文档与仓库元数据 ───
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.vscode/
.idea/
*.md
deploy/
docs/比赛/COMPETITION.md
TODO.md

# ─── 日志 / 临时文件 ───
*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp/
.cache/
*.tmp
*.bak
